       </draw:frame>Figure <text:sequence text:ref-name="refFigure5" text:name="Figure" text:formula="ooow:Figure+1" style:num-format="1">11</text:sequence>: (a) structure of MOSFET, (b) cross section, (c) schematic symbol <text:span text:style-name="T46">(Razavi)</text:span></text:p>
