   <text:p text:style-name="P29"><text:soft-page-break/>This isolation is achieved by taking advantage of the electric field produced by a capacitor. Looking at figure <text:sequence-ref text:reference-format="value" text:ref-name="refFigure4">10</text:sequence-ref>(c), we can control the current through the material by adjusting <text:span text:style-name="T47"><draw:frame text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:y="-0.1228in" draw:z-index="37" draw:name="Shape3" draw:style-name="gr1" draw:text-style-name="P19" svg:width="0.1543in" svg:height="0.1512in">
      <draw:image draw:mime-type="image/svg+xml">
       <office:binary-data>PD94bWwgdmVyc2lvbj0nMS4wJyBlbmNvZGluZz0nVVRGLTgnPz4KPCEtLSBUaGlzIGZpbGUg
